[agentdeck] backend=tmux mode=simulate proto=v4
[agentdeck] config: defaults, 8 prompt presets
[agentdeck] commands: select N | start | approve | always | deny | interrupt | enter | mode | auto | focus | next | prev | scroll N | preset N | send | prompt TEXT | spawn [KIND] | all approve|deny|interrupt|send | keys K.. | btn NAME [up|down] | enc NAME N | key N | page N | view | repeat | move N | copy | quit
[frame] HELLO_ACK proto=4
[discover] slot 0: a-claude-approval (id=%0, kind=claude)
[discover] slot 1: b-spinner (id=%1, kind=shell)
[discover] slot 2: c-idle (id=%2, kind=shell)
[frame] RESET (clear all slots)
[frame] META agents=3 blocked=1
[state] slot 0 a-claude-approval: NONE -> BLOCKED
[frame] SLOT slot=0 state=BLOCKED kind=claude name=a-claude-approval
[state] slot 1 b-spinner: NONE -> IDLE
[frame] SLOT slot=1 state=IDLE kind=shell name=b-spinner
[state] slot 2 c-idle: NONE -> IDLE
[frame] SLOT slot=2 state=IDLE kind=shell name=c-idle
[frame] DETAIL line=0: feature.
[frame] DETAIL line=1: Do you want to proceed?
[frame] DETAIL line=2: > 1. Yes
[frame] DETAIL line=3: 2. No, and tell Claude what
[frame] DETAIL line=4: to do differently
[frame] DETAIL line=5: choice:
[frame] FOOTER idle: P1/8 continue
[frame] BTNLEDS (all the device's)
[state] slot 1 b-spinner: IDLE -> WORKING
[frame] SLOT slot=1 state=WORKING kind=shell name=b-spinner
[select] slot 0 (a-claude-approval)
[action] approve -> slot 0 (a-claude-approval)
[frame] FOOTER good: APPROVED a-claude-approval
[frame] DETAIL line=0: > 1. Yes
[frame] DETAIL line=1: 2. No, and tell Claude what
[frame] DETAIL line=2: to do differently
[frame] DETAIL line=3: choice: 1
[frame] DETAIL line=4: RECEIVED:1
[frame] DETAIL line=5: EDIT APPLIED - task complete
[frame] FOOTER idle: P1/8 continue
[agentdeck] bye
